      "text": "Whether SRC_REC_STAT_CD is populated only for EME sourced rows, or the matching count (11,052,636 both) is a coincidence, has not been confirmed.",
    },
    {
      "id": "pending-validation_570e83b0dafc8bfa3934",
      "text": "How many rows have BSKT_DISC_OPT_FL or EARN_POINTS_FL blank versus a real value, split by recency of last touch, has not been measured.",
    },
    {
      "id": "pending-validation_8a701db584ab225c658e",
      "text": "CLUB_CARD_DIM's real observed run schedule, from a log rather than the header, is still unknown.",
    },
    {
      "id": "pending-validation_0336bb59feca605cf39d",
      "text": "The 15,183 stub member figure from references/anomaly-checklist.md has not been reconciled against this session's 240,954.",
    },
  ],
}
`;

